 "files": [
  {
   "path": "SCENE.md",
   "role": "instructions",
   "content": "# Line Shadow Text\n\nA bold headline with a hatched drop shadow: fine diagonal lines fill the shadow and slide slowly through it.\n\nCategory: typography. Length: 4 s. WebGL: no.\n\nUse when:\n- A headline needs a graphic, print-like shadow with a little life in it.\n- One word in a line should stand out with an engraved hatch shadow.\n\nAvoid when:\n- You want a soft blurred shadow: use a plain text shadow.\n- You want a long solid extruded shadow: use long-shadow.\n\nVariables:\n- text_before (string): Lead-in, default \"Ship\"\n- text (string): Shadowed text, default \"Fast\"\n- font_size (number, 24-400): Font size, default 160\n- color (color): Text colour, default \"#0a0a0a\"\n- shadow_color (color): Shadow colour, default \"#000000\"\n- cycle_seconds (number, 2-60): Cycle, default 15\n\nSource: https://github.com/magicuidesign/magicui. Licence: MIT. The scene file keeps the upstream notice.\n"
  },
  {
   "path": "scene.html",
   "role": "source",
   "content": "<!doctype html>\n<!--\n  Line Shadow Text\n\n  A bold headline with a hatched drop shadow: fine diagonal lines fill the shadow and slide slowly through it.\n\n  Ported to an HTML + GSAP sub-composition by usemosio/blocks from:\n  https://github.com/magicuidesign/magicui/blob/166367b4e31a27f166fd6c2b71d7be290fe0c1bc/apps/www/registry/magicui/line-shadow-text.tsx\n\n  MIT License\n\n  Copyright (c) Magic UI\n\n  Permission is hereby granted, free of charge, to any person obtaining a copy\n  of this software and associated documentation files (the \"Software\"), to deal\n  in the Software without restriction, including without limitation the rights\n  to use, copy, modify, merge, publish, distribute, sublicense, and/or sell\n  copies of the Software, and to permit persons to whom the Software is\n  furnished to do so, subject to the following conditions:\n\n  The above copyright notice and this permission notice shall be included in all\n  copies or substantial portions of the Software.\n\n  THE SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED \"AS IS\", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND, EXPRESS OR\n  IMPLIED, INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO THE WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY,\n  FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE AND NONINFRINGEMENT. IN NO EVENT SHALL THE\n  AUTHORS OR COPYRIGHT HOLDERS BE LIABLE FOR ANY CLAIM, DAMAGES OR OTHER\n  LIABILITY, WHETHER IN AN ACTION OF CONTRACT, TORT OR OTHERWISE, ARISING FROM,\n  OUT OF OR IN CONNECTION WITH THE SOFTWARE OR THE USE OR OTHER DEALINGS IN THE\n  SOFTWARE.\n-->\n<html\n  lang=\"en\"\n  data-composition-id=\"line-shadow-text\"\n  data-composition-duration=\"4\"\n  data-composition-variables='[\n    {\"id\": \"text_before\", \"type\": \"string\", \"role\": \"content\", \"label\": \"Lead-in\", \"description\": \"Plain text before the shadowed word. Leave empty to show only the shadowed word.\", \"default\": \"Ship\"},\n    {\"id\": \"text\", \"type\": \"string\", \"role\": \"content\", \"label\": \"Shadowed text\", \"description\": \"The word with the hatched shadow, set in italic.\", \"default\": \"Fast\"},\n    {\"id\": \"font_size\", \"type\": \"number\", \"role\": \"style\", \"label\": \"Font size\", \"description\": \"Maximum text size in pixels. Longer text shrinks to fit the frame.\", \"default\": 160, \"min\": 24, \"max\": 400, \"step\": 1, \"unit\": \"px\"},\n    {\"id\": \"color\", \"type\": \"color\", \"role\": \"style\", \"label\": \"Text colour\", \"description\": \"Colour of the letters.\", \"default\": \"#0a0a0a\"},\n    {\"id\": \"shadow_color\", \"type\": \"color\", \"role\": \"style\", \"label\": \"Shadow colour\", \"description\": \"Colour of the hatch lines.\", \"default\": \"#000000\"},\n    {\"id\": \"cycle_seconds\", \"type\": \"number\", \"role\": \"motion\", \"label\": \"Cycle\", \"description\": \"Seconds the hatch takes to slide across the text (the source uses 15).\", \"default\": 15, \"min\": 2, \"max\": 60, \"step\": 1, \"unit\": \"s\"}\n  ]'\n>\n  <head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n    <title>Line Shadow Text</title>\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <template>\n      <link\n        rel=\"stylesheet\"\n        href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Geist:ital,wght@0,600;0,700;1,600;1,700&amp;display=block\"\n      />\n      <style>\n        #root {\n          position: absolute;\n          inset: 0;\n          overflow: hidden;\n          container-type: size;\n          pointer-events: none;\n        }\n        .lst-stage { position: absolute; inset: 0; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }\n        .lst-line { font-family: var(--font-display, Geist, system-ui, sans-serif); font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.05em; line-height: 1; white-space: pre; }\n        .lst-word { position: relative; z-index: 0; display: inline-flex; font-style: italic; isolation: isolate; }\n        .lst-shadow {\n          position: absolute;\n          top: 0.04em;\n          left: 0.04em;\n          z-index: -1;\n          white-space: pre;\n          background-size: 0.06em 0.06em;\n          -webkit-background-clip: text;\n          background-clip: text;\n          color: transparent;\n          -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\n        }\n      </style>\n\n      <div id=\"root\" data-composition-id=\"line-shadow-text\" data-duration=\"4\" data-fps=\"30\">\n        <div id=\"lst-clip\" class=\"lst-stage clip\" data-start=\"0\" data-duration=\"4\" data-track-index=\"0\">\n          <span id=\"lst-line\" class=\"lst-line\"><span id=\"lst-before\"></span><span id=\"lst-word\" class=\"lst-word\"><span id=\"lst-main\"></span><span id=\"lst-shadow\" class=\"lst-shadow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></span></span>\n        </div>\n\n        <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/gsap@3.14.2/dist/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n        <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/gsap@3.14.2/dist/CustomEase.min.js\"></script>\n        <script>\n          (function () {\n            \"use strict\";\n            var root = document.getElementById(\"root\");\n            var vars =\n              window.__hyperframes && window.__hyperframes.getVariables\n                ? window.__hyperframes.getVariables()\n                : {};\n            function num(value, fallback, min, max) {\n              var n = Number(value);\n              return Number.isFinite(n) ? Math.min(max, Math.max(min, n)) : fallback;\n            }\n            function str(value, fallback) {\n              return typeof value === \"string\" && value.trim() ? value : fallback;\n            }\n            function col(value, fallback) {\n              return typeof value === \"string\" && value ? value : fallback;\n            }\n            function pick(value, options, fallback) {\n              return options.indexOf(String(value)) >= 0 ? String(value) : fallback;\n            }\n            // Shrink an element's font until it fits a share of the frame width.\n            function fit(el, size, share) {\n              el.style.fontSize = size + \"px\";\n              var max = Math.max(1, root.clientWidth * share);\n              if (el.scrollWidth > max) {\n                size = Math.max(12, size * (max / el.scrollWidth));\n                el.style.fontSize = size + \"px\";\n              }\n              return size;\n            }\n            // A seeded random generator, so every seek draws the same thing.\n            function mulberry32(a) {\n              return function () {\n                a |= 0; a = (a + 0x6d2b79f5) | 0;\n                var t = Math.imul(a ^ (a >>> 15), 1 | a);\n                t = (t + Math.imul(t ^ (t >>> 7), 61 | t)) ^ t;\n                return ((t ^ (t >>> 14)) >>> 0) / 4294967296;\n              };\n            }\n            function clamp01(x) { return x < 0 ? 0 : x > 1 ? 1 : x; }\n            gsap.registerPlugin(CustomEase);\n            var TAG = \"lst\";\n            var bezN = 0;\n            function bez(x1, y1, x2, y2) {\n              return CustomEase.create(TAG + \"-\" + bezN++, \"M0,0 C\" + x1 + \",\" + y1 + \" \" + x2 + \",\" + y2 + \" 1,1\");\n            }\n            var tl = gsap.timeline({ paused: true });\n            function finish() {\n              var total = parseFloat(root.dataset.duration || \"4\");\n              if (tl.duration() < total) tl.to({}, { duration: total - tl.duration() });\n              tl.seek(0);\n              window.__timelines = window.__timelines || {};\n              window.__timelines[\"line-shadow-text\"] = tl;\n            }\n\n            var line = document.getElementById(\"lst-line\");\n            var before = document.getElementById(\"lst-before\");\n            var main = document.getElementById(\"lst-main\");\n            var shadow = document.getElementById(\"lst-shadow\");\n            var lead = typeof vars.text_before === \"string\" ? vars.text_before : \"Ship\";\n            var word = str(vars.text, \"Fast\");\n            var ink = col(vars.color, \"#0a0a0a\");\n            var sh = col(vars.shadow_color, \"#000000\");\n            before.textContent = lead ? lead + \" \" : \"\";\n            line.style.color = ink;\n            main.textContent = word;\n            shadow.textContent = word;\n            shadow.style.backgroundImage = \"linear-gradient(45deg, transparent 45%, \" + sh + \" 45%, \" + sh + \" 55%, transparent 0)\";\n            var size = fit(line, num(vars.font_size, 160, 24, 400), 0.9);\n            var cycle = num(vars.cycle_seconds, 15, 2, 60);\n            var total = parseFloat(root.dataset.duration || \"4\");\n            var tile = 0.06 * size;\n            var clock = { t: 0 };\n            // The source slides background-position from 0 0 to 100% -100%: percentages of\n            // (box - tile), so the hatch travels the box width right and the box height up.\n            function draw(t) {\n              var f = Math.min(1, t / cycle);\n              var x = f * (shadow.offsetWidth - tile);\n              var y = -f * (shadow.offsetHeight - tile);\n              shadow.style.backgroundPosition = x.toFixed(2) + \"px \" + y.toFixed(2) + \"px\";\n            }\n            tl.to(clock, { t: total, duration: total, ease: \"none\", onUpdate: function () { draw(clock.t); } }, 0);\n            draw(0);\n\n            finish();\n          })();\n        </script>\n      </div>\n    </template>\n  </body>\n</html>\n"
  }
 ],
 "sha256": "03c15400369b0c7c04d064b325a2d0d38584df668acdfef42b9774fd869d9a5b",
